      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR FRIEND (3) has been in the placings two times from as many appearances this campaign. Settled handy and closed well to finish second last start over 1690m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Leading hope based on what we have seen of late. A ROCKN NIGHTMARE (8) has had two runs this prep and is yet to finish in the top three. Added to the sequence last time over 2240m at Melton, finishing 14 metres away from the winner in fourth. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Meets a similar line up and she is a strong winning hope. ELLIANA (5) didn't do a bad job when finishing fourth over 2180m at Kilmore last time out. Well worth an each-way ticket. CAPTAIN MILO (2) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish third at this track over 1690m.",
